Package: salt-agent-ubus
Version: 0.1.0-1
Depends: rpcd, uhttpd-mod-ubus
Section: admin
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Christian Prior-Mamulyan <cprior@gmail.com>
Description: Salt agent for OpenWrt ubus JSON-RPC transport
 Creates an rpcd login for the salt user and installs ACL rules
 granting scoped access to UCI, network, and system ubus objects
 via the JSON-RPC API.
